<item rdf:about="https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03621-y">
            <title><![CDATA[Biotech innovations are an opportunity to limit climate change]]></title>
            <link>https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03621-y</link>
            <content:encoded>
                <![CDATA[<p>Nature, Published online: 11 November 2026; <a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03621-y">doi:10.1038/d41586-026-03621-y</a></p>Agricultural biotechnology once found itself in opposition to environmental science. Now it could reduce the impact of food systems on global warming and biodiversity loss.]]></content:encoded>
            <dc:title><![CDATA[Biotech innovations are an opportunity to limit climate change]]></dc:title>
            
            <dc:identifier>doi:10.1038/d41586-026-03621-y</dc:identifier>
            <dc:source>Nature, Published online: 2026-11-11; | doi:10.1038/d41586-026-03621-y</dc:source>
            <dc:date>2026-11-11</dc:date>
            <prism:publicationName>Nature</prism:publicationName>
            <prism:doi>10.1038/d41586-026-03621-y</prism:doi>
